## 2. The underlying spoken content — NOT licensed here

**The words spoken in the recordings are not Prime Rogue Inc.'s to licence.**

Copyright in the broadcasts and in the speakers' contributions rests with their respective
rights holders. Nothing in this repository grants any licence to that material, and no
such licence should be inferred from Part 1.

It is reproduced here for **news reporting, research, criticism and review** under the fair
dealing provisions of the Copyright Act (R.S.C. 1985, c. C-42), ss. 29–29.2. Fair dealing
for news reporting requires attribution, and every transcript in this repository names its
source accordingly.

**If you intend to reuse the spoken content itself, that is between you and the rights
holders. Clear it yourself.**

## 3. No warranty

Provided as-is. See the accuracy notice in `README.md`: these transcripts contain errors,
